# OwnTracks Recorder has no built-in authentication and requires no secrets here.
# Access to the web UI and /pub ingest endpoint is controlled by the Traefik
# basic-auth gate declared in metadata.yaml (basic_auth: true) — the customer's
# server password is applied there, not here.
#
# OTR_PORT=0 is set directly in docker-compose.yaml to disable the MQTT listener.
# The recorder stores location data in /opt/owntracks-recorder/store (created by install.sh).
